# SERVICE

## Greeting

### DESCRIPTION

Greeting service generated from CML.

### OPERATION

#### composeGreeting

Returns a greeting message through a sample-specific factory implementation.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### SUMMARY

Compose a greeting message.

##### INPUT

Greeting query payload.

###### VALUE

